                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Amazing Musou game. I love Musou games and have never seen the anime or watched the manga. By the same artist that does Full Metal Alchemist and it looks great.\n\nUnlike other Musous, you can equip multiple weapons at once and different weapons are better against certain enemies. The character roster is pretty good and the DLC is fun.\n\nDoesn't fully do the manga/anime story but does a good chunk and is generally a very fun Musou.",
